  "description": "🚀 Redx64Lib is a high-performance byte scanning library designed for fast and efficient pattern matching in large data streams. Whether you are searching for hex sequences, signatures, or patterns, Redx64Lib delivers lightning-fast results with minimal performance overhead.\n\n\t\t\t⚡ Key Features:\n\t\t\t✅ Ultra-fast byte sequence search\n\t\t\t✅ Optimized for performance and efficiency\n\t\t\t✅ Supports wildcards and flexible matching\n\t\t\t✅ Works with large data buffers and files",
